#Life 1.05
#D Period 96 replicator based glider gun by David Bell.
#D --- The smallest known glider gun based on replicators.
#D A block perturbs the replicator to produce the glider,
#D while a period 2 "clock" oscillator prevents a spark 
#D from being formed that would modify the block.  
#D One glider is shown where it was just created.
#D From "HighLife - An Interesting Variant of Life 
#D (part 1/3) by David I. Bell, dbell@canb.auug.org.au
#D 7 May 1994
#R 23/36
#P -18 -14
